  "id": "rd-trzic/sava-5",
  "clubSlug": "rd-trzic",
  "slug": "sava-5",
  "code": "Sava",
  "name": "Reka Sava",
  "subtitle": "od izliva Tržiške Bistrice do jezu pri Tekstilindusu - Aquasavi, vključno z Majdičevim kanalom",
  "en": {
   "name": "The river Sava",
   "subtitle": "from the outflow of the Tržiška Bistrica to the dam at Tekstilindus - Aquasava, including the Majdič's channel",
   "description": "The nature is beautiful and the water is clean and hard to access in some areas. The water is rich in salmonids and in 2012 the world championship in fly fishing took place in this district. The water is meant for sports fishing and is extremely salmonid in character - here live brown trouts, rainbow trouts and graylings and in the district you can find some first class specimen of huchen."
  },
  "club": {
   "name": "Ribiška družina Tržič",
   "url": "https://www.ribiskekarte.si/rd-trzic"
  },
  "description": "Izjemno lepa narava s čisto vodo, ki je sicer na nekaterih delih malce težje dostopna. Voda je izredno bogata s salmonidnimi vrstami. V revirju se je leta 2012 odvijalo svetovno prvenstvo v muharjenju. Voda je namenjena športnemu ribolovu in je izrazito salmonidna. Poseljujejo jo potočna postrv, šarenka in lipan. V revirju kraljujejo kapitalni sulci.",
