  "en": {
   "name": "The Tržiška Bistrica",
   "subtitle": "the chine Dovžanova soteska",
   "description": "Do you want to know where to fish? Where to leave your car? What kind of a fly do you need? Just click here and read for free the guide for the river Tržiška Bistrica. From Jelendol to Tržič the Bistrica runs mostly through the canyon well known as \"Dovžanova soteska\". The current steadies itself from Tržič to the outflow into the Sava with bigger dams and thresholds that make fishing even more interesting."
  },
  "club": {
   "name": "Ribiška družina Tržič",
   "url": "https://www.ribiskekarte.si/rd-trzic"
  },
  "description": "Vas zanima kje loviti? Kje pustiti avto? Kakšno muho potrebujete? Kliknite tukaj in preberite brezplačen vodič po Tržiški Bistrici. Od Jelendola do Tržiča teče Bistrica večinoma po kanjonu skozi znano \"Dovžanovo sotesko\". Od Tržiča do izliva v reko Savo pa je tok mirnejši v pravi rečni strugi z večimi jezovi in pragovi, ki popestrijo ribolov. Vsi pritoki Tržiške Bistrice, razen potoka Mošenik, so gojitveni potoki.",
